      },
      "dc:source": "c2013a00006.pdf, p.6",
      "values:originalText": "Each Act that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or\nrepealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule\nconcerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect\naccording to its terms.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00006\n\nCriminal Code amendments  Schedule 1\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Slavery, Slavery-like Conditions and People Trafficking) Act",
      "skos:definition": "Each Act that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or\nrepealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule\nconcerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect\naccording to its terms.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00006\n\nCriminal Code amendments  Schedule 1\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Slavery, Slavery-like Conditions and People Trafficking) Act",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2013a00006-sec-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6360b55a304c2a70140d715185d1c7578b8bd1c6decf7db21e139b34f77889b4",
      "skos:note": "Schedules governing amendments and repeals of Acts"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2013a00006#sec-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3 Schedule(s)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 6,
      "values:originalText": "Each Act that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or\nrepealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule\nconcerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect\naccording to its terms.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00006\n\nCriminal Code amendments  Schedule 1\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Slavery, Slavery-like Conditions and People Trafficking) Act"
    },
