      "dc:source": "c2013a00006.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "Omit “by law there is a duty to perform”, substitute “there is a duty to\nperform by a law of the Commonwealth, a State or a Territory, or at\ncommon law”.",
      "skos:definition": "Omit “by law there is a duty to perform”, substitute “there is a duty to\nperform by a law of the Commonwealth, a State or a Territory, or at\ncommon law”.",
