    {
      "@id": "concept:c2013a00006-sch-1-sec-270-4-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "270(3) 6  Definition of forced labour",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2013a00006#sch-1-sec-270-4-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2013a00006.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2013a00006.pdf, p.11",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The victim may be in a condition of forced labour whether or not:\n\n(a) escape from the condition is practically possible for the\nvictim; or\n\n(b) the victim has attempted to escape from the condition.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00006\n\nSchedule 1  Criminal Code amendments",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The victim may be in a condition of forced labour whether or not:\n\n(a) escape from the condition is practically possible for the\nvictim; or\n\n(b) the victim has attempted to escape from the condition.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00006\n\nSchedule 1  Criminal Code amendments",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2013a00006-sch-1-sec-270-4"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2013a00006-sch-1-sec-270-4-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2013a00006-sch-1-sec-270-4-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "70750731bb031191919ebaf895320b6b63ec188bf123fd257c2f2b7a8045b6c7",
      "skos:note": "The victim may be in a condition of forced labour whether or not escape is practically possible."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2013a00006#sch-1-sec-270-4-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "270(3) 6  Definition of forced labour",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 11,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The victim may be in a condition of forced labour whether or not:\n\n(a) escape from the condition is practically possible for the\nvictim; or\n\n(b) the victim has attempted to escape from the condition.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00006\n\nSchedule 1  Criminal Code amendments"
    },
