      "dc:source": "c2013a00006.pdf, p.15",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of proceedings for a slavery-like offence, the trier\nof fact may have regard to any of the matters covered by\nsubsection (2) in determining whether a person (the alleged victim)\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00006\n\nSchedule 1  Criminal Code amendments",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of proceedings for a slavery-like offence, the trier\nof fact may have regard to any of the matters covered by\nsubsection (2) in determining whether a person (the alleged victim)\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00006\n\nSchedule 1  Criminal Code amendments",
