      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 20,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Subsection (2) only applies if the defendant has been afforded\nprocedural fairness in relation to the finding of guilt for the offence\nagainst section 271.5.\nNote:\nSection 271.5 provides for offences of domestic trafficking in persons."
    },
    {
