    {
      "@id": "concept:c2013a00006-sch-1-sec-271-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "271 7E  Domestic organ trafficking—aggravated offence",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2013a00006#sch-1-sec-271-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2013a00006.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2013a00006.pdf, p.22",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person (the offender) commits an aggravated offence of\ndomestic organ trafficking if the offender commits an offence of\ndomestic organ trafficking in relation to another person (the victim)\nand any of the following applies:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00006\n\nCriminal Code amendments  Schedule 1\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Slavery, Slavery-like Conditions and People Trafficking) Act",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A person (the offender) commits an aggravated offence of\ndomestic organ trafficking if the offender commits an offence of\ndomestic organ trafficking in relation to another person (the victim)\nand any of the following applies:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00006\n\nCriminal Code amendments  Schedule 1\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Slavery, Slavery-like Conditions and People Trafficking) Act",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2013a00006-sch-1-sec-271-8-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2013a00006-sch-1-sec-271-8-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "65f55244e2fe6474f4d637b21a859bd0f6aee42af2df953a344fcfa9c18bda0b",
      "skos:note": "Aggravated offence of domestic organ trafficking"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2013a00006#sch-1-sec-271-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "271 7E  Domestic organ trafficking—aggravated offence",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 22,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person (the offender) commits an aggravated offence of\ndomestic organ trafficking if the offender commits an offence of\ndomestic organ trafficking in relation to another person (the victim)\nand any of the following applies:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00006\n\nCriminal Code amendments  Schedule 1\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Slavery, Slavery-like Conditions and People Trafficking) Act"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2013a00006-sch-1-sec-271-8-norm",
