      },
      "dc:source": "c2013a00006.pdf, p.23",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person (the offender) commits an offence of harbouring a victim\nif:\n\n(a) the offender harbours, receives or conceals another person\n(the victim); and\n\n(b) the harbouring, receipt or concealing of the victim:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00006\n\nSchedule 1  Criminal Code amendments",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A person (the offender) commits an offence of harbouring a victim\nif:\n\n(a) the offender harbours, receives or conceals another person\n(the victim); and\n\n(b) the harbouring, receipt or concealing of the victim:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00006\n\nSchedule 1  Criminal Code amendments",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
