      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2013a00006.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2013a00006.pdf, p.25",
      "values:originalText": "(2) If, on a trial for an offence against this section, the trier of fact is\nnot satisfied that the defendant is guilty of the aggravated offence,\nbut is satisfied that the defendant is guilty of an offence against\nsection 271.8, it may find the defendant not guilty of the\naggravated offence, but guilty of an offence against that section.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) If, on a trial for an offence against this section, the trier of fact is\nnot satisfied that the defendant is guilty of the aggravated offence,\nbut is satisfied that the defendant is guilty of an offence against\nsection 271.8, it may find the defendant not guilty of the\naggravated offence, but guilty of an offence against that section.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2013a00006-sch-1-sec-271-11"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2013a00006-sch-1-sec-271-11-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2013a00006-sch-1-sec-271-11-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2013a00006-sch-1-sec-271-11-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a9ebd259a8ddbc819e578066d8571b9cea61f9c77699909bb5e0fee265ad3f6a",
      "skos:note": "If defendant is guilty of an offence against section 271.8, but not the aggravated offence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2013a00006#sch-1-sec-271-11-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "271(2) 9  Debt bondage—aggravated offence",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 25,
      "values:originalText": "(2) If, on a trial for an offence against this section, the trier of fact is\nnot satisfied that the defendant is guilty of the aggravated offence,\nbut is satisfied that the defendant is guilty of an offence against\nsection 271.8, it may find the defendant not guilty of the\naggravated offence, but guilty of an offence against that section."
    },
