      "skos:note": "Afford procedural fairness in relation to finding of guilt for the offence against section 271.8."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2013a00006#sch-1-sec-271-11-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "271(3) 9  Debt bondage—aggravated offence",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 25,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Subsection (2) only applies if the defendant has been afforded\nprocedural fairness in relation to the finding of guilt for the offence\nagainst section 271.8.\nNote:\nSection 271.8 provides for the offence of debt bondage."
    },
