    {
      "@id": "concept:c2013a00006-sch-2-sec-15",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15 Subparagraphs 5D(3A)(a)(ii) and (iii)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2013a00006#sch-2-sec-15"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2013a00006.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2013a00006.pdf, p.31",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subparagraphs, substitute:\n\n(ii) section 270.3, 270.5, 270.6A, 270.7, 270.7B or 270.8\n(slavery or slavery-like conditions);\n\n(iii) section 271.2, 271.3, 271.4, 271.5, 271.6 or 271.7\n(trafficking in persons);\n\n(iv) section 271.7B, 271.7C, 271.7D or 271.7E (organ\ntrafficking);\n\n(v) section 271.7F or 271.7G (harbouring victims);\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00006\n\nSchedule 2  Amendments of other Acts",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the subparagraphs, substitute:\n\n(ii) section 270.3, 270.5, 270.6A, 270.7, 270.7B or 270.8\n(slavery or slavery-like conditions);\n\n(iii) section 271.2, 271.3, 271.4, 271.5, 271.6 or 271.7\n(trafficking in persons);\n\n(iv) section 271.7B, 271.7C, 271.7D or 271.7E (organ\ntrafficking);\n\n(v) section 271.7F or 271.7G (harbouring victims);\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00006\n\nSchedule 2  Amendments of other Acts",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2013a00006-sch-2-sec-15-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2013a00006-sch-2-sec-15-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1151e3aa7d319d63e605c25ce0a059d608fc9dfb8597c43fcf016e1d211858b3",
      "skos:note": "Repeal specific sections related to slavery and human trafficking."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2013a00006#sch-2-sec-15",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15 Subparagraphs 5D(3A)(a)(ii) and (iii)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 31,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subparagraphs, substitute:\n\n(ii) section 270.3, 270.5, 270.6A, 270.7, 270.7B or 270.8\n(slavery or slavery-like conditions);\n\n(iii) section 271.2, 271.3, 271.4, 271.5, 271.6 or 271.7\n(trafficking in persons);\n\n(iv) section 271.7B, 271.7C, 271.7D or 271.7E (organ\ntrafficking);\n\n(v) section 271.7F or 271.7G (harbouring victims);\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00006\n\nSchedule 2  Amendments of other Acts"
    },
    {
